menu "Example configuration"
    config EXAMPLE_DEV_COUNT
        int "Number of ADS111x"
        default 2
        range 1 2
        help
            Number of ADS111x devices on the bus. The example expects them at
            the two addresses the ADDR pin selects: GND (0x48) and VCC (0x49).

    rsource "../../../Kconfig.i2c"
endmenu
